        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are absolutely delighted to present 2 Garden Terrace, Clanbrassil Street Upper, Dublin 8 to the market a truly exceptional one-bedroom terraced cottage that has been renovated from top to bottom and is presented in immaculate turnkey condition throughout. Nestled just off Clanbrassil Street, this property enjoys an unbeatable city centre location with every conceivable amenity on its doorstep. A fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, bars and shops are all within walking distance. The area is exceptionally well connected by numerous bus routes and offers the perfect balance of vibrant city living and residential charm.\n\nBeautifully designed and thoughtfully upgraded, the internal accommodation comprises of an open plan living and dining area, modern fully fitted kitchen, generous double bedroom and a stylish contemporary bathroom. Every inch of the property has been carefully refurbished to an exceptionally high standard, creating a home that is both functional and full of character.\n\nNo. 2 offers a rare opportunity to acquire a fully renovated cottage in one of Dublin's most sought-after city locations. Whether you're a first-time buyer seeking a turnkey home, an investor looking for a premium rental property or someone looking to downsize, this property is sure to impress. The added benefit of no onward chain ensures a smooth and straightforward transaction for the successful purchaser.\n\nCombining charm, quality and an unrivalled location, No. 2 Garden Terrace is a true gem in the heart of Dublin 8. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 39 sqm\n• BER G\n• 1 Bed / 1 Bath\n• Terraced cottage\n• On street parking\n• Electric heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Patio to the rear\n• Renovated from top to bottom\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• No onwards chain\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised\n"
      },
      {
